container.append(workbench);`,render:()=>m},{title:"2. The layout it hands back",codeTitle:"Draft, and applied",codeDescription:"Dragging edits a DRAFT the workbench keeps to itself; zen-layout-apply fires only when View Data is pressed. That is the same split the List Report makes between the filter bar and the table, and for the same reason: re-querying a pivot on every drag is fine over 48 rows and hostile over 48 million. The value below only moves when you press the button.",code:`// what zen-layout-apply hands you (e.detail):
